---
layout: base.njk
title: "Justin Mazzola, ex-cheat dev turned security engineer"
description: "Justin Mazzola is an ex-cheat dev turned senior security engineer. Writing on reverse engineering, anti-cheat, Windows internals, and RE with and without AI."
---
{%- import "icons.njk" as icons -%}
{%- set recent = collections.posts.slice(0, 4) -%}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="shell hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1 class="hero-name"><span class="hero-handle">Just</span>in <span class="hero-handle">Mazz</span>ola</h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline"><span class="seg">software/reverse engineer</span>&nbsp;<span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> <span class="seg hl">ex-cheat dev</span>&nbsp;<span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> <span class="seg">senior security engineer</span></p>
      <p class="hero-hook">
        I spent years breaking online games, from Xbox 360 modded lobbies to Windows kernel drivers.
        Since 2016 I've pointed the same skills the other way: anti-cheat, anti-piracy, and DRM.
        This is where I write about <strong>taking software apart</strong>, with and without AI.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/about/">Read the story {{ icons.svg("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/blog/">Browse the blog</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="dump" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="dump-bar"><span>justmazz.exe</span><span>IMAGE_DOS_HEADER</span></div>
      <pre class="dump-body">
{%- for row in hexdump.rows %}
{%- if row.gap %}
<span class="dump-row dump-gap">........  ...</span>
{%- else %}
<span class="dump-row{% if row.hot %} is-hot{% endif %}"><span class="dump-off">{{ row.offset }}</span><span class="dump-hex">{{ row.bytes.slice(0, 8) | join(" ") }}<span class="dump-hex-hi"> {{ row.bytes.slice(8) | join(" ") }}</span></span><span class="dump-asc">{{ row.ascii }}</span></span>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</pre>
      <figcaption class="dump-foot"><span>e_magic <b>MZ</b></span><span>e_lfanew <b>0x80</b></span><span>stub <b>patched</b></span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="recent-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Latest</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="recent-title">Recent posts</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">All posts {{ icons.svg("arrow-right", 15) }}</a>
    </div>

    {%- if recent | length %}
    <ul class="post-list" role="list">
      {%- for post in recent %}
      {% include "post-row.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="empty">
      {{ icons.svg("terminal", 22) }}
      <h3 class="empty-title">Nothing published yet</h3>
      <p>The first write-up is still in the debugger. Follow <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.twitterUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">@{{ site.twitter }}</a> to catch it when it lands.</p>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="cats-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Categories</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="cats-title">Pick a lane</h2>
        <p class="lanes-sub">SIMD interests. Scalar attention span.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lanes">
      <div class="lanes-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lanes-reg">xmm0</span><span>4 &times; 32-bit</span></div>
      <ul class="cat-grid" role="list">
        {%- for slug in site.categoryOrder %}
        {%- set count = collections.posts | filterByCategory(slug) | length %}
        {%- set cat = site.categories[slug] %}
        {%- set tag = "a" if count else "div" %}
        <li>
          <{{ tag }} class="cat-tile{% if not count %} is-empty{% endif %}"{% if count %} href="/blog/?category={{ slug }}"{% endif %}>
            <span class="cat-tile-top">
              <span class="cat cat-{{ slug }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="cat-tile-op" aria-hidden="true">pextrd eax, xmm0, {{ loop.index0 }}</span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="cat-tile-name">{{ cat.name }}</h3>
            <p class="cat-tile-blurb">{{ cat.blurb }}</p>
            {%- if count %}
            <span class="cat-tile-count">{{ count }} {{ "post" if count == 1 else "posts" }} {{ icons.svg("arrow-right", 14) }}</span>
            {%- else %}
            <span class="cat-tile-count">Soon</span>
            {%- endif %}
            <span class="cat-tile-lane" aria-hidden="true">[{{ loop.index0 }}]</span>
          </{{ tag }}>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="band">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Backstory</p>
        <h2 class="band-title">I wrote cheats for years before I switched sides.</h2>
        <p>Flash trainers, then Xbox 360 mods, then kernel drivers and hypervisors on PC, until I quit. The about page has the rest: why I stopped, where I've worked since, and what I work with now.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about/">Read the about page {{ icons.svg("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
